  "performance_interpretation": [
    "All figures are native Windows Vulkan Forward+ with hosted llvmpipe, not TITAN RTX throughput. Profiles provide the measured post-warmup interval; screenshot HUDs include earlier capture/startup effects and are not the final interval summary.",
    "Wall-frame and application-update timings are measured elapsed CPU sections. RenderingServer device timing on llvmpipe remains software rendering.",
    "Every recorded matter region in the reviewed preset profiles reports one geometry build and one topology upload despite ongoing parameter and optical changes. Allocated resources may exceed active resources because legacy and optical materials are retained persistently.",
    "Geometry and particle upload byte totals are submission estimates, not measured PCIe or driver traffic. Material-uniform counters count setters, not GPU commands.",
    "Spatial presentation timing excludes snapshot allocation/deallocation; solver, snapshot, presentation, graph and whole-application times must remain distinct.",
    "The heavy inherited optical source scenes remain expensive under llvmpipe. Their workloads were retained; no physical-GPU performance conclusion follows."
